ame>Gower</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>GJS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Minimum Spanning Trees and Single Linkage Cluster Analysis</article-title><source>The Royal Statistical Society Series C-Applied Statistics</source><year>1969</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>54</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ripley</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><source>Pattern Recognition and Neural Networks</source><year>1996</year><publisher-name>Cambridge University Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kohonen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of SOM point densities based on different criteria</article-title><source>Neural Comput</source><year>1999</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>2081</fpage><lpage>2095</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10578045</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kasif</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>GEMS: a web server for biclustering analysis of expression data</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>W596</fpage><lpage>599</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15980544</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chao</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lihui</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Feature Dimension Reduction For Microarray Data Analysis Using Locally Linear Embedding</article-title><source>Proceedings Of The 3rd Asia-Pacifi